* `lift_theta_congr`: `θ_Γ(Ψ)` does not depend on `Γ` (as a function on `X`, a.e.).
* `lift_theta_translate`: `θ(σ·Ψ)(Q) = θ(Ψ)(σ⁻¹Q)` for `σ ∈ SL₂(R)`.
* `cf_theta_translate`: the constant term of `θ_Ψ` at the cusp `σ⁻¹∞`, i.e. of `Q ↦ θ_Ψ(σ⁻¹Q)` at
  `∞`, is `zRes(σ·Ψ)·ht^{2/3}`.
-/

